{"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}],"title":"Switching Content","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Move an existing player from one video to another without tearing it down."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/contentswitching"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/switchContent(to:_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" replaces the content playing in a live player. It","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps the player, the rendering surface, and the immersive space intact, which makes it the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"right call for “up next” rails, recommendation panels, and channel switching. Creating a new","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","isActive":true},{"text":" per video would instead drop and rebuild the surface — on visionOS that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"means visibly leaving and re-entering the immersive space.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the player has not started anything yet, ","type":"text"},{"code":"switchContent(to:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" falls back to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/startStream(video:_:)","isActive":true},{"text":", so it is safe to call as the single entry point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for playback.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Changing the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"player","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" rather than the video — moving a session from an immersive space into a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"window, say — is the opposite trade and needs a new manager: see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Switching","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Switching"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As with ","type":"text"},{"code":"startStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", pre-fetching the signaling file removes a network round trip from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inside the switch:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["func switchTo(video newVideo: Video) async {","    guard newVideo != currentVideo else { return }","","    do {","        let signaling = try await player.fetchSignalingFile(video: newVideo)","        try await player.switchContent(to: newVideo, signaling)","    } catch {","        loadFailure = error.localizedDescription","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The switch tears down the previous item, stops analytics tracking for it, resolves the new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"item’s signaling, and starts the new stream. Analytics restart automatically for the new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"content.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Reflecting-the-Transition-in-Your-UI","text":"Reflecting the Transition in Your UI","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/isSwitchingContent"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the duration of the call. Drive a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loading state from it, and disable the controls that would race the switch:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["player.isSwitchingContent","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] switching in","        self?.isSwitchingContent = switching","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Button(\"Play\") { … }","    .disabled(vm.isSwitchingContent)"]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Re-bind your player subscriptions around a switch rather than reusing them."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Which bindings apply depends on the content — a control room item exposes a camera selector"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and per-camera language sets that a flat item does not. Cancel your subscriptions, call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"switchContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then re-subscribe and re-read","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/controlRoomSelectorViewModel()"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reset your own transport state as part of the switch too: position, duration, subtitle cue,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the selected audio and subtitle languages all belong to the outgoing item.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Reacting-to-Playback-Ending","text":"Reacting to Playback Ending","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/itemDidEnd"},{"text":" publishes the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Video"},{"text":" that just finished. Use it to chain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"straight into the next item rather than dismissing the player:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["player.itemDidEnd","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] finished in","        guard let next = self?.nextUp(after: finished) else { return }","        Task { await self?.switchTo(video: next) }","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"]},{"anchor":"Handling-Failures","text":"Handling Failures","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/playbackError"},{"text":" reports errors that surface after playback has begun, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinct from the error thrown by the ","type":"text"},{"code":"switchContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call itself:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["player.playbackError","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] error in","        self?.loadFailure = error.localizedDescription","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"]},{"anchor":"Ads-and-Switching","text":"Ads and Switching","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A schedule set through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/ads"},{"text":" belongs to the content it was scheduled","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against and is cleared when the content changes. Schedule the new item’s breaks after the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"switch completes — see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK":{"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"YBVRAppleSDK","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK","abstract":[{"text":"YBVR Apple SDK for streaming and displaying VR video on iOS and visionOS.","type":"text"}]},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/Drm":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where encrypted content plays, where it cannot, and how the SDK decides which it is."}],"kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"FairPlay DRM","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/drm"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager":{"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"YBVRPlayer is an object that provides the interface to display videos inside custom geometries."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"YBVRPlayerManager"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"YBVRPlayerManager"}],"title":"YBVRPlayerM